### IntelliJ IDEA ###
# The project builds with Maven; IntelliJ regenerates *.iml and .idea/modules.xml
# and .idea/libraries/ on import, so those are not tracked. A few stable .idea/*.xml
# (misc, encodings, vcs) stay tracked; per-developer state via .idea/.gitignore.
*.iml
.idea/modules.xml
.idea/libraries/
.idea/artifacts/
.kotlin

